      "mass": 0.9833767870504834,
      "p_a_slot": 0.16372385964369313,
      "p_a_canonical": 0.8362761403563068,
      "prose": {
        "text": "Move to a four-day week.\n\nOne reason is that research has shown that employees who work a four-day week tend to be more focused and productive during their working hours, as they have more time to recharge and prioritize their tasks.",
