      "p_a_canonical": 0.11173356050951029,
      "prose": {
        "text": "I choose: Keep the five-day week.\n\nOne reason is that the data suggests a 20% cut in hours has to be repaid in full by intensity to leave revenue per employee flat, but it is repaid at about two thirds, indicating that the four-day week may not be as effective in maintaining revenue per employee as the five-day week.",
